        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Stan Dragoti, Ismet Toto\n- Places: Tepelenë, Progonat, Vjosa River, Gjirokastër County\n- Events: 2015 local government reform in Albania\n\nFacts:\n- Tepelenë is a town in Albania on the banks of the Vjosa River in Gjirokastër County.\n- Stan Dragoti came from Tepelenë.\n- In the 2015 local government reform in Albania, Progonat became part of the municipality of Tepelenë.\n- Ismet Toto was originally from Progonat.",
