        "original_id": "382cbe27-ddfe-5acc-b20f-78903d15e450",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Progonat, Tepelenë, Gjirokastër County, Vjosa River, Drino, Albania, New York City\n- People: Ismet Toto, Stan Dragoti\n- Organizations: Kurvelesh municipality, Tepelenë municipality\n- Roles: bureaucrat, publicist, writer, revolutionary\n\nFacts:\n- Progonat is a village in the former Kurvelesh municipality in Gjirokastër County.\n- Ismet Toto was born in Progonat in 1908 and was an Albanian bureaucrat, publicist, writer, and revolutionary.\n- Stan Dragoti was born in New York City to Albanian parents who had emigrated in the 1920s from the district of Tepelenë in southern Albania.\n- Ismet Toto died in Gjirokastër in 1937.\n- In 2015, the local government reform made Progonat part of the municipality of Tepelenë.\n- Tepelenë is a town and a municipality in Gjirokastër County in southern Albania.\n- Tepelenë is located on the left bank of the Vjosa River, about three kilometres downstream from the river's confluence with the Drino.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
